{"id":"665694","name":"炒腐竹","author":"给宝贝做的饭","authorId":"1900992","desc":"","cover":"images/665694/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"腐竹","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"青红辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"去皮五花肉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"腐竹加温水、盐、白醋，盖上盖子泡发。","img":"images/665694/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"焯一下水。","img":"images/665694/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"五花肉、青红辣椒改刀。","img":"images/665694/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中加入少许底油，下入五花肉片煸炒出油脂。加入葱蒜炒香。","img":"images/665694/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"烹入料酒，加一点老抽炒香炒至融合。","img":"images/665694/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下入腐竹翻炒均匀。","img":"images/665694/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入生抽、蚝油、盐、白胡椒粉定好味。","img":"images/665694/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入少许清水略煮，让腐竹更加入味。","img":"images/665694/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后加入青红辣椒大火翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/665694/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665694/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665694/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665694/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}